# ==========================================================================
# ROUTER JEV - chien luoc SemanticRouter:Strategy = Jev (mac dinh)
# Mo hinh quyet dinh Jev (TypeSafe) tra loi mot cau hoi Choice: moi route la
# mot option, option "truy_van_tri_thuc" dung DAU (Jev nghieng ve option dung truoc).
# Can TYPESAFE__APIKEYS__0 trong .env; thieu key thi app tu choi khoi dong.
# "score" = xac suat cua route; khop khi Jev chon route do VA score >= threshold.
# Cac ca RANH GIOI o khoi LLM phia tren cung phai qua voi Jev - chay lai ca hai.
# Neu cau pha tron / cau tri thuc bi route nham: nang Jev:MinProbability hoac
# sua Jev:Instructions / Description cua route (co the viet bang tieng Anh -
# Jev chinh xac nhat voi tieng Anh).
# ==========================================================================

### JEV route: chao hoi (ky vong chitchat, score = xac suat >= 0.7)
