GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/cache-stats
Accept: application/json

### 7. Khoi dong lai app roi hoi lai cau o buoc 3 -> route MISS
# Quyet dinh dinh tuyen CHI song trong RAM (khong ghi xuong query-cache.bin),
# nhung normalization/embedding VAN hit vi dinh dang file khong doi.
GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/cache-stats
Accept: application/json

###
# ==========================================================================
# DO TRE DINH TUYEN - routeJev / routeLlm (log muc Information, logger LatencyLogReporter)
# Ca hai router do CUNG mot cua so: tu luc gui cau hoi di toi luc chon xong route
# (Jev: gui -> nhan JSON -> so nguong xac suat; LLM: gui -> nhan chu -> doc nhan).
# Stage nay LONG trong "route"; "route" con tinh ca buoc tra cache quyet dinh.
#   Strategy=Jev -> routeJev     Strategy=Llm -> routeLlm     Off/Embedding -> khong co
# Khoi dong lai app truoc khi chay (cache quyet dinh chi song trong RAM).
# CHAN DOAN:
#   - R-1 khong co routeJev/routeLlm -> TimedRouteClassifier chua duoc boc trong
#                                       AddJevRouter / AddLlmRouter
#   - thay "routeJev=... x2"         -> con mot lop do khac ghi trung ten stage
#   - routeJev > route               -> sai thu tu boc (stage con phai nam TRONG route)
# ==========================================================================

### R-1. Cau chao MOI TINH -> cache truot, router that duoc goi
# Ky vong: Độ trễ [ask] ... route=chitchat ... | route=812.3ms | routeJev=810.9ms | ...
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Lan", "npcSystem": "vui vẻ, thân thiện", "Question": "chào bác thợ rèn, hôm nay bác khỏe không" }

### R-2. Gui lai Y HET R-1 -> cache quyet dinh trung
# Ky vong: route=0.1ms va KHONG co routeJev / routeLlm.
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Lan", "npcSystem": "vui vẻ, thân thiện", "Question": "chào bác thợ rèn, hôm nay bác khỏe không" }

### R-3. Cau tri thuc MOI TINH -> router VAN duoc goi, quyet dinh la "khong khop"
# Ky vong: tag route=none, CO routeJev / routeLlm, sau do moi toi embedding, vectorSearch...
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Lan", "npcSystem": "vui vẻ, thân thiện", "Question": "tối hôm vụ án bác có thấy ai đi qua lò rèn không" }

