### G-7. Doc nguyen van mot chunk, co loc quyen NPC.
GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/chunk?code=25_phap-y%23L8&npcName=Edward
Accept: application/json

### G-8. Cung chunk do nhung hoi bang Jack -> phai 404.
GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/chunk?code=25_phap-y%23L8&npcName=Jack
Accept: application/json

### G-9. Xem DUNG user prompt se gui cho LLM (dung truoc buoc sinh cau tra loi).
# Ton 1 luot nhung, va khi do thi bat thi them 1 luot LLM trich thuc the.
# Chay voi Graph:Enabled = true roi false: ban false phai ra relationCount 0, extraTextCount 0,
# va userPrompt giong het RAG thuan tung byte.
# Khong ghi dong log latency: endpoint debug khong mo phien do. Muon thay vectorSearch /
