### G-11. Danh muc thuc the ma mot NPC duoc biet - dung "thuc don" dua cho LLM trich thuc the.
# Khong goi LLM. Danh muc cua Jack KHONG duoc co thuc the nao chi xuat than tu "25_phap-y";
