###
# ==========================================================================
# ROUTE BENCHMARK - so sanh Llm vs Jev tren bo cau co dinh
#   Bo cau: RAG/Benchmark/route-benchmark.csv (sua CSV roi dotnet run lai, KHONG sua code)
#   Cau hinh: Config/route-benchmark.json (Strategies, NoRouteLabel = "rag", ...)
# Chi mo khi RouteBenchmark:Enabled = true VA dang o Development (khong thi 404).
# Moi lan chay ~90 luot goi: 30 chuan hoa (co cache) + 30 Groq + 30 Jev.
# Router tra Match = null -> tinh la nhan "rag".
# topCandidate / topCandidateScore: route diem cao nhat ke ca khi duoi nguong (Jev).
#
# DIEU KIEN DO CONG BANG giua hai router:
#   - latencyMs: tu luc gui cau hoi toi luc chon xong route (sau chuan hoa, KHONG qua cache).
#   - Cung han 5s: TypeSafe:TimeoutSeconds = SemanticRouter:Llm:TimeoutSeconds.
#   - WarmupQuestion: goi thu moi router 1 lan truoc khi do (bo handshake luot dau).
#   - AlternateOrder: cau chan chay Llm->Jev, cau le Jev->Llm.
#   - Luot API loi / qua han: failed = true, correct = false, va KHONG tinh vao
#     avg/median/maxLatencyMs. Tong so luot loi o summaries[].failures.
# ==========================================================================

### Benchmark day du 30 cau
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/route-benchmark
Accept: application/json

### Chi liet ke cau co it nhat mot router chon sai (summary van tinh tren ca bo)
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/route-benchmark?onlyMistakes=true
Accept: application/json
